# Zhansaya University Management System

## Project Overview
This is a Spring Boot application for managing university data with JWT security.

## Tech Stack
- Java 17
- Spring Boot 3
- Spring Security (JWT)
- Swagger UI (OpenAPI 3.0)

## How to run
1. Clone the repository.
2. Run `./gradlew bootRun`.
3. Open `http://localhost:8081/swagger-ui/index.html`